# 4️⃣ NETWORK_LINK vs DBMS_FILE_TRANSFER (Custom RDS)

| Feature     | NETWORK_LINK | DBMS_FILE_TRANSFER |
| ----------- | ------------ | ------------------ |
| Dump file   | ❌ No         | ✅ Yes              |
| Speed       | Faster       | Slower             |
| Resume      | Yes          | No                 |
| Use case    | Migration    | File movement      |
| Recommended | ⭐⭐⭐⭐         | ⭐⭐                 |




